294
00:24:19,430 --> 00:24:21,824
Well , when you say it like that , of course it sounds ridiculous .

295
00:24:21,911 --> 00:24:23,913
Ridiculous ? It 's stupid !

296
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:25,872
But , Norman , when you want things to happen or not to happen

297
00:24:25,959 --> 00:24:27,743
to someone you love .

298
00:24:27,830 --> 00:24:31,442
Oh , Norman , the things I did . They seem to work .

299
00:24:31,529 --> 00:24:33,140
What things ?

300
00:24:33,227 --> 00:24:35,316
At least , most of the time .

301
00:24:35,403 --> 00:24:36,970
Don 't you see the very exceptions

302
00:24:37,057 --> 00:24:38,710
prove the things you were doing didn 't work ?

303
00:24:38,797 --> 00:24:40,234
