304
00:24:40,321 --> 00:24:42,453
I can 't believe it !

305
00:24:42,540 --> 00:24:43,977
A woman of your intelligence .

306
00:24:47,197 --> 00:24:49,243
Is this the way you 've been spending your time at the cottage ?

307
00:24:51,723 --> 00:24:53,073
And I thought that you were ...

308
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:59,383
