314
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:22,841
Yes ! Their hatred and their petty jealousy .

315
00:25:22,929 --> 00:25:24,713
- I was afraid they would destroy us . - Tansy .

316
00:25:24,800 --> 00:25:28,456
You 're imagining these things . What 's got into you ?

317
00:25:28,543 --> 00:25:30,371
