365
00:27:54,993 --> 00:27:57,170
Well , let me tell you something .

366
00:27:57,257 --> 00:27:58,562
That faculty would 've seen you dead a long time ago if they could 've managed it !

367
00:27:58,649 --> 00:28:00,738
Now stop it ! You 're being hysterical !

368
00:28:00,825 --> 00:28:01,435
- No , I 'm not ! I 'm telling the truth ! - Just because you 're ...

369
00:28:01,522 --> 00:28:02,175
