408
00:32:08,899 --> 00:32:10,423
Yes . Everything .

409
00:32:35,839 --> 00:32:37,972
Wake up , you bloody fool !

410
00:32:38,059 --> 00:32:39,452
This is a restricted area . You 're not supposed to be doing 60 !

411
