427
00:33:23,452 --> 00:33:25,672
No . Must hurry . I 'm late .

428
00:33:33,767 --> 00:33:36,334
I think it 's about time we got a few things straightened out , Taylor .

429
00:33:37,510 --> 00:33:39,729
