453
00:34:27,037 --> 00:34:29,475
Do you realize the seriousness of such a disgusting accusation ?

454
00:34:29,562 --> 00:34:31,651
- It is disgusting ! - Get out !

455
00:34:31,738 --> 00:34:33,870
At first I was willing to give you the benefit of the doubt ,

456
00:34:33,957 --> 00:34:35,481
