471
00:35:09,732 --> 00:35:11,125
It concerns you and Margaret Abbott .

472
00:35:12,953 --> 00:35:16,478
Margaret ? She 's certainly in the limelight this morning .

473
00:35:16,565 --> 00:35:18,698
