But we 've got to handle this carefully .

480
00:35:37,543 --> 00:35:39,632
Remember , she 's Flora 's ward .

481
00:35:39,719 --> 00:35:41,416
You better come with me .

482
00:35:54,951 --> 00:35:57,388
Do you realize the enormity of this accusation against

483
00:35:57,475 --> 00:35:59,477
Professor Taylor , Margaret ?

484
00:35:59,565 --> 00:36:01,958
I thought a great deal before coming to you

485
00:36:02,045 --> 00:36:06,484
