494
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:48,178
Kindness ! Attention ! They 're just words to hide the truth .

495
00:36:48,265 --> 00:36:50,441
And I 've always respected you .

496
00:36:50,528 --> 00:36:53,619
Kindness and attention from a teacher to a student , and nothing more .

497
00:36:53,706 --> 00:36:55,664
